  "143": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "SCENE 1 — SEARCH ENGINES ARE JUST LIBRARIANS\n\n<Picture 1> is the absolute authority for the presenter’s identity and character design. Preserve the supplied female character’s head shape, eyes, eyebrows, nose, mouth, skin tone, compact simplified proportions, clothing, and recognizable facial expressions. Preserve the exact hairstyle or hair state shown in <Picture 1>. Do not add, remove, shorten, lengthen, recolor, or redesign the hair.\n\n<Picture 2> is the supplied home-studio reference. Reinterpret the entire studio as a simple nostalgic hand-drawn 2D Japanese family-anime environment: thick clean black outlines, flat pastel colours, rounded simplified shapes, minimal cel shading, almost no gradients, and slightly imperfect hand-drawn linework.\n\nEverything in the scene — presenter, desk, microphone, monitor, graphics, text, icons, transitions, and effects — must use the same flat hand-drawn 2D anime style.\n\nNo photorealism.\nNo live action.\nNo realistic skin.\nNo 3D objects.\nNo glossy CGI.\nNo mixed visual styles.\n\n0:00-0:03:\nMedium-wide shot of <Subject 1> sitting at the studio desk.\n\nShe suddenly leans forward and points directly at the viewer with her right index finger.\n\nThe camera performs a fast digital punch-in toward her face.\n\n<Subject 1> says:\n<d>[English, Neutral British Female Voice] Google looks like magic, but the basic idea is actually very simple.</d>\n\n0:03-0:06:\nHard cut to a side angle.\n\nA large hand-drawn filing cabinet appears floating to the presenter’s LEFT.\n\nThe cabinet consists of exactly THREE stacked pastel-blue drawers with thick black outlines.\n\nThe presenter turns toward it and gestures with both hands.\n\n<Subject 1> says:\n<d>[English, Neutral British Female Voice] You are basically asking a giant library a question.</d>\n\n0:06-0:10:\nThe presenter snaps her fingers.\n\nA loud WHOOSH plays.\n\nThe studio instantly disappears.\n\nA solid black background replaces everything.\n\nExactly TWO lines of thick white uppercase text slam into the centre:\n\nWEB = MESSY\nINDEX = ORGANIZED\n\nThe first line sits approximately 45 percent down the screen.\nThe second line sits approximately 58 percent down the screen.\nBoth lines use large bold condensed block lettering.\n\n<Subject 1> says:\n<d>[English, Neutral British Female Voice] The web is a messy place. An index makes it organized.</d>\n\nHard cut."
    },
    "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
    "_meta": {
